{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>In Achmeta.</b> Some say that it is from חמת מים, or it is the name of a vessel in which records documents are stored." "<b>In Birata.</b> It is ארמון תרגום; in our Aramaic translation, בברניתנא."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {1 "Ibn Ezra quotes the Targum's rendering of the Hebrew; both Aramaic forms left in Hebrew script as they appear in his text."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:02.072950248Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}